I am still standing in the office.
A colleague comes over to me and smiles.
"Hello, I am Jonas," he says.
"Welcome to the team!"
"Hello Jonas, I am Maya," I answer.
We use "du" right away.
"Where do you come from, Maya?" Jonas asks.
"I come from Mexico," I say.
"How long have you been in Berlin?" he then asks.
"Since January," I answer.
"I am completely new here in the city."
Jonas nods.
"We are ten people," he says.
"We work a lot, but we also have fun."
"I am also a software engineer."
"That is great," I say.
"I will show you your desk now," Jonas says.
We walk through the office together.
